Package: F2Adonis2
Title: PERMANOVA using the F2 Statistic
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lakviru", "Perera", email = "korathotagelaperera@montana.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-7717-3532")),
    person("Mark", "Greenwood", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6933-1201"))
    )
Language: en-US
Description: Implements the F2 statistic of Anderson et al. (2017)
    <doi:10.1111/anzs.12176> for permutational multivariate analysis of
    variance (PERMANOVA) on dissimilarity matrices. The F2 statistic uses
    group-specific dispersion estimates, so group centroids can be compared
    when dispersions differ and group sizes are unequal. P-values are
    obtained by permutation, bootstrap, or bias-adjusted
    bootstrap. The formula interface follows 'adonis2()' in the 'vegan'
    package.
